00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:44.060
aos administradores de Mac

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:44.980
e o Intune para tudo o resto.

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:46.220
As duas plataformas

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:46.640
se integram,

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:47.580
então o Jamf pode enviar

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:48.380
