00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:16.840
o Intune

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:17.720
provavelmente está rodando

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:18.860
nos bastidores agora mesmo

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:19.740
